WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.317
Read his chart in two steps: composition first, texture second. The

00:00:05.317 --> 00:00:08.930
composition groups are felsic, intermediate, mafic, and ultramafic.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.919
Granite and rhyolite can have similar composition. Slow cooling makes coarse

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:19.488
granite; rapid cooling makes fine rhyolite. Likewise, compare diorite with andesite,

00:00:19.488 --> 00:00:21.150
and gabbro with basalt.

00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:26.889
Use the mineral bands too: quartz and potassium feldspar suggest felsic

00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:31.803
composition; olivine and pyroxene are characteristic of mafic and ultramafic rocks.
